else
talu
end
flow w add w 1
end
note BL: the callee's entry state joins the caller's registers (x30 public), a fresh stack; after the
note call the registers are the callee's exit summary, the caller's own slots and depth are kept
fn pbl w ulong to void
t = get dc dtgt
if ge t get gv 0
unh w 11
ret
end
r = get cu 0
s = get cu 1
d = get cu 2
f = get cu 3
put cu 0 and r not shl ulong 1 30
put cu 1 not ulong 0
put cu 2 0
put cu 3 t
if eq get trp t 0
join t
end
put cu 1 s
put cu 2 d
put cu 3 f
if ne get exs t 0
put cu 0 get ex t
flow w add w 1
end
end
fn requeue f ulong to void
n = get gv 0
for a ulong 5
for b ulong 500000
j = add mul a 500000 b
